  "description": "The proposal comprises the replacement of existing windows for new UPVC sliding sash windows to all elevation. Roof replacements and/or locaslised repairs using welsh slate roof tiles to match the existing profile where necessary. Targeted cleaning and repair of the building’s external masonry to halt localised deterioration and preserve its appearance and performance using a DOFF steam cleaning method to safely remove biological growth and surface soiling, followed by like-for-like repairs such as repointing, replacing damaged masonry, and securing any loose façade elements. No alterations are proposed to the building’s form, layout, or access; the project is purely conservation-focused to extend the building’s service life. Installation of a discreet lightning conductor to all building to safeguard the building and its occupants. Installation of pigeon control items/systems.",
